  "description": "Medicare coverage guidelines for lumbar spinal fusion. Requires documented spinal instability (grade 1 or higher spondylolisthesis or dynamic translation > 3mm on flexion-extension radiographs), severe neurogenic claudication or radiculopathy, and failure of at least 3 months (90 days) of structured conservative care.",
